---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import pipeline from '../../assets/bike-datalakehouse/pipeline.png';
import ProjectSection from './ProjectSection.astro';
---

<div class="bike-case-study">
  <ProjectSection id="architecture-heading" title="Architecture">
    <div class="case-copy">
      <p>
        Two operational systems feed a layered Delta Lake pipeline. Bronze keeps
        the original records available for replay and investigation; Silver
        standardizes and validates each business entity; Gold publishes a star
        schema ready for BI and analytical queries.
      </p>
      <div
        class="layer-flow"
        aria-label="CRM and ERP data flow through Bronze, Silver, and Gold layers to business intelligence"
      >
        <span>CRM + ERP</span>
        <i>→</i>
        <span>Bronze</span>
        <i>→</i>
        <span>Silver</span>
        <i>→</i>
        <span>Gold</span>
        <i>→</i>
        <span>BI</span>
      </div>
      <figure class="pipeline-figure">
        <Image
          src={pipeline}
          alt="Databricks job graph showing the Bronze layer feeding customer, product, sales, demographic, location, and category Silver jobs, which feed Gold customer and product dimensions and a Gold sales fact table"
          widths={[640, 960, 1440, 1952]}
          sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 780px"
          format="webp"
          quality={90}
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <figcaption>
          The production job graph makes dependencies and successful execution
          visible across the full pipeline.
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </ProjectSection>

  <ProjectSection id="model-heading" title="Analytics Model">
    <div class="case-copy">
      <p>
        The Gold layer uses a deliberately compact star schema. One row in the
        fact table represents a sales order line, linked through surrogate keys
        to a single current customer and product record.
      </p>
      <div
        class="star-model"
        role="img"
        aria-label="Fact sales table connected to customer and product dimension tables"
      >
        <div class="model-card dimension">
          <span>DIMENSION</span>
          <strong>dim_customers</strong>
          <small>Identity · Geography · Demographics</small>
        </div>
        <div class="model-card fact">
          <span>FACT</span>
          <strong>fact_sales</strong>
          <small>One row per sales order line</small>
        </div>
        <div class="model-card dimension">
          <span>DIMENSION</span>
          <strong>dim_products</strong>
          <small>Product · Category · Cost · Attributes</small>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </ProjectSection>

</div>

<style>
  .case-copy > p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .layer-flow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 26px;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .layer-flow span {
    padding: 9px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: var(--tag-bg);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .layer-flow i {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-style: normal;
  }
  .pipeline-figure {
    margin: 30px 0 0;
    padding: 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 7px;
    background: #101a21;
  }
  .pipeline-figure img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
  figcaption {
    padding: 12px 7px 5px;
    color: #c2ceba;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .star-model {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.08fr 1fr;
    gap: 18px;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }
  .model-card {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 150px;
    padding: 22px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--surface);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .model-card + .model-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    right: 100%;
    width: 19px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--accent);
  }
  .model-card span {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .model-card strong {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 17px;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .model-card small {
    margin-top: 10px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .fact {
    min-height: 184px;
    background: var(--sage);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  .code-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 18px;
  }
  .code-grid > div {
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .code-grid h3 {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-size: 16px;
  }
  pre {
    height: calc(100% - 34px);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 18px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 5px;
    background: #17251c;
    color: #e7eddf;
    font: 13px/1.7 var(--mono);
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .layer-flow {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: flex-start;
    }
    .layer-flow span {
      flex: 1 1 92px;
    }
    .star-model,
    .code-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .model-card + .model-card::before {
      top: auto;
      right: 50%;
      bottom: 100%;
      width: 0;
      height: 19px;
      border-top: 0;
      border-left: 1px solid var(--accent);
    }
  }
</style>
